1	select	Select an option
1	option	Do you know what happened in the castle cellar?
2	line	Player	Do you know what happened in the castle cellar?
2	line	NPC	Last night I was in the kitchen and I heard a noise from the cellar. I opened the trapdoor and saw a creature dart into a hole in the wall.
2	line	NPC	It looked a bit like a goblin, but it had big bulging eyes. It wasn't wearing armour, but it had this odd helmet with a light on it.
2	line	NPC	The tunnel was too dark for me to follow it, so I went to tell the Duke. But when we went down to the cellar the hole had been blocked up, and no one believes me.
2	line	Player	I believe you.
2	line	NPC	Thank you, {player}! If you can convince the Duke I'm telling the truth then we can get to the bottom of this mystery.
2	action	end
