0	section	Meeting the Lost Tribe
0	section	Greetings
1	line	Mistag	Who...who are you? How did you get in here?
1	line	Mistag	Help! A surface-dweller this deep in our mines? We will all be destroyed!
1	action	end
1	cond	If the player performs the Goblin Bow emote:
2	line	Mistag	A human knows ancient greeting?
2	line	Mistag	Perhaps you are friend after all!
2	line	Mistag	Greetings, friend. I am sorry I panicked when I saw you.
2	line	Mistag	Our legends tell of the surface as a place of horror and violence, where the gods forced us to fight in terrible battles.
2	line	Mistag	When I saw a surface-dweller appear I was afraid it was a return to the old days!
2	line	Player	Did you break in to the castle cellar?
2	line	Mistag	It was an accident. We were following a seam of iron and suddenly we found ourselves in a room!
2	line	Mistag	We blocked up our tunnel behind us and ran back here. Then we did what cave goblins always do when there is a problem: we hid and hoped it would go away.
2	line	Mistag	We meant no harm! Please tell the ruler of the above- people that we want to make peace.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player performs the Goblin Salute emote:
2	line	Mistag	Eeek! The war-dance!
2	action	end
